## About our repair services

Eagle Span Corporation handles commercial truck repair for heavy-duty trucks,
fleets, buses, trailers, RVs and heavy equipment. Our technicians work across
axles, brakes, diagnostics, tires, wheel alignment and transmissions, and the
shop has seven service bays with the tools and diagnostic equipment the work
actually needs.

Repairs get diagnosed before they get quoted. A code read and a part replaced is
how a truck comes back for the same fault a second time, so we measure first —
which is also why the alignment and diagnostics pages are where a surprising
number of repairs actually start.

